{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16899","headline":"西亭早秋送徐员外 · 武元衡","name":"西亭早秋送徐员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鼎铉辞台座，麾幢领益州。\n曲池连月晓，横角满城秋。\n有美皇华使，曾同白社游。\n今年重相见，偏觉艳歌愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16899.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16899","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}